msgstr "An FAQ is already published in llms.txt (generated on %s). If you save this step again (with “Save settings” or “Continue”), the AI rewrites it using this text as a reference and the result replaces the published one: it may change. To keep the current one, leave the step with “Back” or from the progress bar, without saving."

#: admin/class-admin.php:413
